      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Ah I see, thanks for taking a look! That would explain why this is happening, sending another 0 seems to fix the issue indeed. \n\nI would just maybe recommend documenting this behaviour on your \"OSC as Input Controller\" page. It does currently describe that for buttons you have to reset to 0 first, but it has no mention that you'd have to reset afterwards as well, to make sure other inputs remain available. \n\nOther than that, consider it resolved!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
