  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The last bug for the OSC input addresses breaking input thankfully got fixed, but it's still not working correctly. \n\nThe current issue is that when the mute state is toggled through the `/input/Voice` address, the bindings for toggling the mute state stop working completely in-game. This is the case both for the keyboard binding (V), as well as the SteamVR controller binding.\n\nThe mute state can still be toggled through the expression- or action menu. \n\nThe bindings start working again when the player manually disables OSC and re-enables it via the expression menu (Until the next time voice muting is toggled over OSC)\n\nRelevant issue: https://github.com/Raphiiko/OyasumiVR/issues/83",
